{{-- The WordPress admin theme's dashboard (`wp-admin/index.php`): Ignite's dashboard widgets, the same the default theme shows, in WordPress's dashboard boxes (`.postbox` with its `.postbox-header` heading). The list widgets (`ListWidget`: At a Glance, `wp_dashboard_right_now`, and Activity, `wp_dashboard_recent_posts`) fill the first column, each row as WordPress lists it (a value such as the date first, then the label or its link); the form widgets (`FormWidget`: Quick Draft, `wp_dashboard_quick_press`) fill the second, posting to their resource's create with their hidden values and the way back, as Ignite's widget does. The stat cards (`StatsOverviewWidget`) are not shown: WordPress has no such cards, and At a Glance gives the same counts. --}}@extends('ignite::layouts.app')

